g enhanced mystic invul) Fixed Enhanced Weighted Shots not maintaining the benefits from Enhanced Slowing Bullets Lady Geist Life Drain heal reduced from 80% to 75% Abrams Siphon Life heal reduced from 80/40% to 70/35% Fixed speed coming out of canceling Shoulder Charge being too high when hitting a hero Apollo Disengaging Sigil base damage reduced from 100 to 85 Billy Rising Ram T3 now also reduces cooldown by 10s Celeste Bullet cycle time reduced from 0.65 to 0.58 Shining Wonder radius increased from 14m to 15.5m Shining Wonder damage increased from 120 to 135 Doorman Fixed a bug that could allow you to bring the Urn through a doorway Drifter Rend T3 now also increases melee scaling (1.2 to 1.6) Bloodscent T3 increased from +10% Amplified Damage to +12% Dynamo Kinetic Pulse spirit scaling reduced from 1.8 to 1.65 Quantum Entanglement cooldown increased from 19s to 20s Haze Restored being able to slide while using Bullet Dance Bullet Dance range increased from 15m to 16m Bullet Dance now has 30% evasion in the base ability Bullet Dance T2 changed from \"+10% Fire Rate and -45s Cooldown\" to \"+10% Fire Rate and +3m Move Speed\" Bullet Dance T3 changed from \"+60% Evasion and +4m Move Speed\" to \"+40% Evasion and -75s Cooldown\" Holliday Fixed Rising Ram interrupting Lasso Spirit Lasso T1 increased from +68 Damage to +80 Spirit Lasso T3 increased from -30s Cooldown to -50s Infernus Flame Dash DPS spirit scaling reduced from 1.0 to 0.7 Flame Dash DPS now does half damage to objective McGinnis Mini Turrets bounty from 80 + 2/minute to 40 + 4/minute Fixed Mini Turrets being locked on objectives when they were invulnerable Medicinal Specter duration increased from 6s to 6.5s Mina Nox Nostra DPS reduced by 6% Mirage Base health regen reduced from 2 to 1.5 Fire Scarabs duration reduced from 8s to 7s Mo & Krill Burrow move speed increased from +4 to +5 Paige Stamina increased from 2 to 3 Dash speed reduced to slow bucket Plot Armor cooldown reduced from 30s to 28s Bookwyrm recharge timer reduced from 8s to 7s Paradox Kinetic Carbine cooldown reduced from 30s to 28s Time Wall T2 weapon damage increased from +30% to +35% Kinetic Carbine now provides +20% Air Dash Distance when charged Pocket Enchanter's Satchel spirit scaling increased from 0.9 to 1.1 Affliction cooldown reduced from 150s to 140s Rem Fixed a bug with Naptime that allowed you to attack while casting it Pillow Toss recharge timer reduced from 10s to 9s Shiv Alt fire knockback reduced by 10% Serrated Knives spirit scaling reduced from 0.15 to 0.13 Serrated Knives T3 spirit scaling reduced from +0.1 to +0.09 Silver Fixed Tail Whack applying -12% Bullet Resist for the Disarm duration Slam Fire Current Health As Damage reduced from 4% to 3% Venator Gutshot damage scaling reduced from 0.8 to 0.7 Gutshot wall hit damage scaling reduced from 0.9 to 0.8 Victor Aura of Suffering T2 increased from +28 Max DPS to +34 Shocking Reanimation T3 increased from -100s Cooldown to -130s Viscous Goo Ball lockout period from being affected again reduced from 1.35 to 1.2 (a previous bug with increased debuff resistance for subsequent CC not working correctly on this ability was fixed recently) Fixed various locations where Splatter didn't bounce properly Vyper Lethal Venom cooldown increased from 24s to 28s Lethal Venom T2 increased from -8s Cooldown to -12s Lethal Venom cast range reduced from 15m to 10m and now scales with boons (0.2) Fixed Armor Piercing Rounds doing damage through Petrify Active Reload Fire Rate increased from +22% to +25% Lifesteal reduced from 18% to 14% Opening Rounds Weapon Damage reduced from +45% to +30% Now upgrades from High-Velocity Rounds (includes it's stats) Spirit Power reduced from +10 to +7 Split Shot Max Stacks reduced from 6 to 5 Weapon Damage per stack reduced from 10% to 8% Cooldown increased from 24s to 27s Shadow Weave Moved from T4 to T3 Out of Combat Regen reduced from 10 to 5 Duration reduced from 18s to 10s Ambush duration reduced from 8s to 5s Cooldown increased from 32s to 45s Spot Radius increased from 18m to 20m Ambush Spirit Power reduced from 35 to 20 Ambush Fire Rate reduced from 32% to 20% Ambush Melee damage reduced from 25% to 20% Alchemical Fire Spirit Power increased from +8 to +10 Heroic Aura Cooldown reduced from 25s to 22s Bullet Resistance aura increased from 15% to 17% Blood Tribute Now has an innate 8% Debuff Resistance Active Debuff Resist reduced from 40% to 35% Spiritual Overflow No longer grants +15% Spirit Lifesteal as base stat Now provides +15% Ability Duration Activated buff no longer provides +20% Ability Duration Activated buff now provides +20% Spirit Lifesteal Lifesteal reduced from 20% to 16% (part of a global adjustment on top of the prior rework to the item) Frenzy No longer grants +20% Spirit Resistance when below 50% Health No longer grants +15% Base Spirit Resistance No longer grants +0.75m Base Move Speed Now grants +160 Health Base Fire Rate increased from 10% to 15% Low HP Move Speed increased from 2.5 to 4 Low HP now grants +30% Debuff Resistance (when Low HP procs, any existing debuffs are reduced by 30% duration) Low HP Fire Rate increased from +25% to +40% Low HP bonus is now given for a duration and has a cooldown, whenever you are below the 50% threshold. Lasts 10s and has an 16s Cooldown. Restorative Locket Max Stacks increased from 20 to 25 (max stamina restore happens at 25 stacks now) Heal per stack reduced from 20 to 16 Return Fire Bullet Resistance increased from 8% to 10% Bullet Damage Returned increased from 60% to 65% Reactive Barrier No longer restores 1 stamina on trigger No longer grants +6% Spirit Resist Now triggers off of Silence (same trigger set as Indomitable) Cooldown increased from 40s to 55s Barrier spirit scaling reduced from 2.1 to 1.8 Trophy Collector Moved from T3 Item to T2 Souls per stack reduced from 25 to 18 Out of Combat regen reduced from 4 to 2 Ability Range reduced from +1% Per Stack to +0.75% No longer gives +20 Health per stack 